App limit. Say it with me. App limit!

11
00:01:06.684 --> 00:01:10.984
Focus time. Say it with me. Focus time!

12
00:01:14.556 --> 00:01:18.673
Balance. Say it with me. Balance!

13
00:01:22.131 --> 00:01:39.723
Digital wellbeing means using technology in a mindful way that supports my health. Turning off an unnecessary notification and taking a screen break protects my sleep quality. Setting an app limit helps me protect my focus time and overall balance.

