Mindful use!

17
00:01:52.332 --> 00:01:57.916
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:57.966 --> 00:01:59.304
Focus time!

19
00:02:00.442 --> 00:02:07.724
Did you know? Studies show that using a screen right before bed can make it harder to fall asleep quickly!

20
